  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Old Ghost Bai Jun holds Fang Leng and Fang Yun captive in green ghost desert and treats killing them as too costly, because the clan would identify him as the culprit. Fang Di Chang is second supreme elder and a famous wisdom path expert of Western Desert. Fang Leng is a talent among rank sixes and a possible successor, a direct great-grandson of the first supreme elder. Fang Yun is that second supreme elder’s adopted son. Old Ghost Bai Jun means to demand ransom and talk terms with the first supreme elder.",
      "chapters": [
        1504
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captives-in-the-desert",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_ghost_bai_jun",
        "char_fang_leng",
        "char_fang_yun",
        "char_fang_di_chang",
        "reg_western_desert"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges that occupying green ghost desert still leaves this clan as a neighbor he cannot get around. The clan has a rank eight first supreme elder. Fang Yuan treats this generation’s second supreme elder, Fang Di Chang, as a wisdom path great expert renowned in Fang Yuan’s first life. He has wisdom path great grandmaster attainment, and is also marked in Shadow Sect’s information.",
      "chapters": [
        1505
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "occupying-green-ghost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Clan affairs are decided by the first supreme elder and the second supreme elder. After Qing clan was exterminated, Fang clan’s ancestors began searching for that clan’s inheritance. Fang clan is famous for its Gu houses. The clues name Immortal Gu House Divine Bean Palace, created by Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable and left in Western Desert. The resolve to obtain it has been carried generation after generation.",
      "chapters": [
        1507
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-hunt",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_qing_clan",
        "sys_gu_house",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_divine_bean_palace",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    }
  ],
